      "alt": "Text only. Force on A: B is driven by f, a = f/m_B, F_A = (m_A + m_B)f/m_B. Force on B: A is driven by f, a = f/m_A, F_B = (m_A + m_B)f/m_A. So F_B/F_A = m_B/m_A = 5/4.",
